			"width": 400,
			"height": 260,
			"text": "# Welcome to Canvas\n\nAn infinite canvas for connecting your thoughts.\n\n- **Drag** nodes to move them\n- Drag a **side handle** to connect nodes\n- Scroll to pan, `Ctrl/⌘ + scroll` to zoom\n- Double-click empty space to add a note",
			"color": "6"
		},
